-- Value predicates (ex7). Twin of 07-value-predicates.bqn.
-- Statements are sequential barriers: greedy row 0 holds only because statement 1's +100 committed first (500 is not > 550; 600 is) — the .bqn's barrier witness is row 0 of the greedy expect. Row 4 (90>90 false, strict) stays greedy from its initial 1: +Greedy is a mask-or. *= 0.5 down a mask is v×1-0.5×mask; speed row 2 (10<10 false, strict) stays 4.
--! registry 07-value-predicates
--! expect gold = 600 700 600 100 90
--! expect greedy = 1 1 0 1 1
--! expect speed = 4 6 4 1 10

Gold == 500 , Gold += 100
Gold > Health * 10 , +Greedy
Stamina < Weight , Speed *= 0.5
